      "updated": 1774808585659,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. RAG pipeline based on LlamaIndex\n2. Working with Quadrant Database\n3. Modular Arcitecture for an AI application\n4. REST API design for AI services\n5. Testing with pytest\n6. Evaluations of RAG based AI applications (DeepEvals)\n7. Dockerization of AI application\n8. CI/CD on Github actions\n9. Deployment on AWS",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. RAG pipeline based on LlamaIndex\n2. Working with Quadrant Database\n3. Modular Arcitecture for an AI application\n4. REST API design for AI services\n5. Testing with pytest\n6. Evaluations of RAG based AI applications (DeepEvals)\n7. Dockerization of AI application\n8. CI/CD on Github actions\n9. Deployment on AWS",
